    {
      "text": "Removes automatic target lock. The laser becomes an unlimited-pierce beam along mech facing and damages every enemy it crosses at the full current damage rate."
    },
    {
      "text": "Focus builds while the player's facing remains within 12° of its previous direction. It decays at twice the current focus-gain rate between 12° and 25° and resets beyond 25°."
    },
    {
      "text": "Range remains the upgradeable laser range and beam width is fixed at 0.35M."
    },
    {
      "text": "This preserves maximum focused DPS but turns a safe tracker into a manually aimed horde cutter."
    }
  ]
